<title>USA: FSA qualifies three more muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies three more muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said it has qualified for bond insurance three additional municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Pickens County School District, S.C., $3.205 million and $3.060 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Collierville, Tenn., $12.2 million water and sewer bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
